From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Il tuo nome <tu@esempio.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:55:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mb/lenovo/haswell: Put Hyper-Threading in the setup menu

The Lenovo setup of the T440p and the W541 has Intel Hyper-Threading
Technology, on by default. Add the option of the Haswell CPU code to
Energy Saver -> Processor, first as on the ThinkCentre M920x.

TEST=Build of the ThinkPad W541 with the native RAM init.

Change-Id: I8154f257ed1ed1c0c3d6d6d1ecaeed256d397aaa
---
 src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c
index 826dff6c5b..40ea1a465a 100644
--- a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c
+++ b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c
@@ -401,6 +401,7 @@ static const struct sm_object energy_battery = SM_DECLARE_FORM({
 static const struct sm_object energy_processor = SM_DECLARE_FORM({
 	.ui_name	= "Processor",
 	.obj_list	= (const struct sm_object *[]) {
+		&hyper_threading,
 		&eist,
 		&turbo_mode,
 		&c_states,
-- 
2.43.0

